# Intentionally NOT ignored:
# /data/observatory.db — the SQLite database is committed on purpose.
#   It is the research artifact. Every commit is part of the public record.
# /reports/*.md — monthly reports are committed on purpose.
# /.cache/tldextract/ — vendored PSL snapshot for reproducible domain normalization.
#   Pinning the cache ensures month-to-month runs use an identical snapshot.
